Third-party software
--------------------

mosaicWave uses the following open-source software. Each is under its own license;
see the project's own license text.

Python (installed from PyPI at install or build time):
  FastAPI, Uvicorn, SQLAlchemy, python-multipart   MIT / BSD
  Pillow                                           HPND
  pillow-heif                                      BSD-3-Clause (wheels bundle libheif, LGPL)
  imageio-ffmpeg                                   BSD-2-Clause (wheels ship an FFmpeg binary, GPL/LGPL build)

Web (compiled into the static web UI):
  Next.js, React                                   MIT

Packaging:
  WinSW (Windows service wrapper, shipped in the MSI)   MIT
  QNAP QDK (build tool, not linked or shipped)          GPL
  WiX Toolset (build tool, not shipped)                 OSMFEULA

mosaicWave installers do not bundle FFmpeg or libheif themselves. They are installed
with the Python packages above. If a future installer bundles them, their license texts
and source offers must be shipped with it.

